---
title: Pudding Pie
description: When you wanted to feel like you cooked something.
servings: 6
image: https://bunnystyleguide.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Vanilla-Pudding-Pie.jpg
---

Beat together @instant pudding {2%3oz pkg} and @milk{3.5%cups} in a #bowl{} until thick and creamy.

Pour pudding into the @graham cracker crust{1}(premade, 9-inch). Either lightly shake to even out or spread with spoon.

Place the crust lid back on, inverted so it looks like a nicer lid, and then crimp the sides to seal. Chill in the fridge until firm.

Top with @?whipped cream{}.

> To spice it up, you can use the oreo crust or any pudding mix you prefer, but obviously vanilla and graham cracker crust is the classic.